    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 10 Oakwood Retirement Village, Roscommon Town, Co. Roscommon Keith McLoughlin of Sheehy Meares Team Earley is delighted to present this attractive two-bedroom semi-detached bungalow, ideally located in the peaceful Oakwood Retirement Village just minutes from Roscommon Town. This property comes to the market in excellent, turnkey condition and will appeal to those seeking to downsize, retire in a secure and tranquil setting, or invest in a well-located home. Extending to approximately 78 sq.m. (840 sq.ft.) and built in 2006, the residence is bright, spacious, and well maintained throughout. The accommodation comprises an inviting entrance hallway, a large living/sitting room filled with natural light from generous windows and sliding doors, and a fully fitted kitchen/dining area with ample storage. There are also two well-proportioned double bedrooms and a main family bathroom. Externally, the property offers a neat, low-maintenance finish that blends seamlessly with the landscaped surroundings of the development. The Oakwood Retirement Village provides a peaceful and secure environment with well-maintained communal green areas, creating a strong sense of community. Ideally positioned close to all amenities in Roscommon Town, the property is within easy reach of shops, cafés, restaurants, medical facilities, and leisure options, making it both convenient and highly desirable. This is an excellent opportunity to acquire a quality home in a sought-after and quiet residential setting, suitable for both owner-occupiers and investors alike. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
